{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52499","headline":"独鹤篇 · 刘希夷","name":"独鹤篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西山日没人独归，东江月明鹤孤[飞]（非）。\n秋风四起声切切，边心一听泪[霏霏]（非非）。\n嵩岳灵泉摇玉羽，蓬丘仙雾下金衣。\n自[怜]（拎）流落烦岁暮，唯有悲凉人事非。\n（见伯二六八七卷）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}